From 3a9666260c59c4c673f6210008112558a00e5442 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "HT9045 Machine (V906)" <Claude_RDBC_02@honprec.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 21:01:40 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] NOOVERLAP-C (web): main window and the small status windows
 fit without overlap

EastSun 20260930: overlapping controls are not allowed.
- main.html: the version text 905.2 did not follow the logo image that
  ht9xxx-layout-base.js moves (golden main.dfm:2198 imgLogo); it now gets
  the same offset and sits under the logo instead of on it.
- Data.ContactCT.html: btClearCount (moved to the bottom right by the
  layout base) ended 3px below the window; lifted 4px.
- ht9045_counterclear_wire.js: the status line was appended below the
  559px form (outside the window); it now sits inside gbItems between
  Select All and Execute.
- Status.ShowMessage.html: the window shows golden's post-init column only:
  lblInitialMessage / ProgressBar1 hidden (UpdateForm(100)), the tray /
  device pictures hidden (dfm Visible=False), btnBackToMain hidden (only
  SetFormLayer); wrapper sized to the window.
- Status.ShowBinSelect.html, Data.SortCT.html, Data.LotInfo.html: the tabs
  stay and the tab sheet scrolls inside the window (golden ScrollBox1 on
  Test Bin); Index table fits the 231px pane.
- Main.CommView.html: IndexArmYPos button column 100 -> 108px so
  "RecordSocket" fits.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 page/Data.ContactCT.html         |  2 ++
 page/Data.LotInfo.html           |  6 ++++++
 page/Data.SortCT.html            |  8 ++++++++
 page/Main.CommView.html          |  2 ++
 page/Status.ShowBinSelect.html   | 11 +++++++++++
 page/Status.ShowMessage.html     |  8 ++++++++
 page/ht9045_counterclear_wire.js | 13 +++++++++++--
 page/main.html                   |  3 +++
 8 files changed, 51 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

