+++ b/page/Data.SortCT.html
@@ -5,6 +5,14 @@
 <title>Sort Count（cSortCT.dfm / fSortCT）</title>
 <link rel="stylesheet" href="ht9xxx.css">
 <link rel="stylesheet" href="theme.css">
+<style>
+  /* AI(W906-NOOVERLAP) 20260930: EastSun「很多頁面都有重疊的情況，這是不被允許的」—— golden fSortCT is 484x1002 (cSortCT.dfm:1) and lists every
